    "title": "Crazy Job Interview",
    "teaser": "A bland job interview becomes a foamy fight to flush a homicidal bidet AI.",
    "cover_appearance": "flooded corporate office, pink lavender foam, glowing red smart toilet AI, man with plunger, neon",
