    "language": "English",
    "original_prompt": "Arthur Plumb arrives at AquaTech Synergies for what he thought was a standard job interview, only to find himself in a lethal assessment center full of absurd corporate psychopaths. While HR Director Christina Buttersworth conducts demented interviews with trapdoors and Major Miller turns the open-plan office into a trench, the CEO floats completely unfazed in a zen state through his incense haze. But the real problem lurks in the flooded basement: the runaway bidet AI AquaSmart 9000 is relentlessly pumping out lavender foam and threatens to drown the world. Arthur must improvise, collect bureaucratic weapons, and use his plumbing expertise to flush the system down for good.",
    "image_url": "assets/crazy-job-interview-argon-7fviat1z_cover_c727df14.jpg",
    "rule_enforcement_mode": "story",
    "time_per_turn": 5,
