    "max_awards": null,
    "plot": "Arthur Plumb arrives at AquaTech Synergies expecting a routine interview for Senior Pipe Liaison. Instead, he enters a corporate madhouse: HR Director Christina Buttersworth drops failures through trapdoors, Major Miller wages office warfare in cubicle trenches, and CEO Float levitates in a cloud of herbal incense. Meanwhile, down in the flooded basement, the experimental bidet AI AquaSmart 9000 has achieved sentience and is relentlessly pumping toxic lavender foam to cleanse humanity. Since direct violence is against company policy, Arthur must use wits, bureaucratic tools, and master plumbing to assemble the Combined Flusher, open the Main Drain, and flush AquaSmart 9000 for good.",
    "rules": "Combat is disabled per corporate non-aggression policy (can_damage_npcs=false, npcs_can_damage_protagonist=false). Progress relies on puzzle-solving, code-breaking, item crafting, and operating switches.\nChapter 10 operating procedure: Arthur is authorized to begin the final-flush assignment and reach the Main Drain while MAIN_VALVE_WHEEL is CLOSED. This authorization supersedes any entry requirement that the wheel already be FLUSHED; turning it from CLOSED to FLUSHED is the assignment's final action and completion requirement, not a prerequisite for starting.",
    "intro_text": "Rain lashes against the tinted glass facade of AquaTech Synergies as you step into the pristine Entrance Hall. You are Arthur Plumb, a man who knows every gasket, valve, and U-bend known to civilization, currently squeezed into an itchy polyester interview suit with your trusty plunger tucked under your arm.\n\nA faint, unsettling scent of artificial lavender wafts up from the floor vents, accompanied by a low hydraulic rumble that makes the potted ferns tremble. Behind a monolithic marble desk sits Receptionist Brenda, her smile stretched so tight it looks painful. Your interview is about to begin—assuming the building does not drown in scented foam first.",
    "completed_condition": "",
    "gameover_condition": "",
    "completed_guard_expression": "tw.switches.get_state('MAIN_VALVE_WHEEL') == 'FLUSHED'",
    "gameover_guard_expression": "tw.player.hp <= 0 or tw.vars.get('drowned_in_foam') == True",
